# A tree that checks clean: the root, a child module in a file, one in a directory with a
# child of its own, and a test module (claude/modules-style-pass.md).
# Written by Claude on the claude-self-hosting branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Words
mod Geometry
test mod Tests
use Ui
use Words.*
use Geometry.*

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Label(text=$"{Name (Double 2)}")
